<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>طلبك قيد المراجعة</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">

  <style>
    .pending-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px 16px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .pending-page::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 420px;
      height: 420px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.18);
      filter: blur(90px);
      top: -140px;
      right: -100px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .pending-page::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 360px;
      height: 360px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.16);
      filter: blur(90px);
      bottom: -140px;
      left: -90px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .pending-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 620px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .pending-card {
      background: rgba(24, 34, 53, 0.88);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 34px 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.38);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .pending-icon {
      width: 82px;
      height: 82px;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 38px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(99,102,241,0.35);
    }

    .pending-card h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .pending-subtitle {
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      max-width: 470px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .pending-status {
      margin: 26px 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .pending-step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 15px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .pending-step-icon {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
      background: rgba(99,102,241,0.16);
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .pending-step-text strong {
      display: block;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .pending-step-text span {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .pending-note {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(99,102,241,0.10);
      border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.18);
      color: #dbeafe;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .pending-actions {
      margin-top: 26px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .pending-btn {
      min-width: 180px;
      height: 50px;
      padding: 0 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: .22s ease;
    }

    .pending-btn.primary {
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(99,102,241,0.35);
    }

    .pending-btn.primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(99,102,241,0.45);
    }

    .pending-btn.ghost {
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    .pending-btn.ghost:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .pending-footer {
      margin-top: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .pending-card {
        padding: 26px 18px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      .pending-card h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .pending-subtitle {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .pending-step {
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .pending-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .pending-btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d6efd">
  <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Rabie Physics">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png">

</head>

<body>

  <main class="pending-page">
    <div class="pending-wrap">

      <section class="pending-card">

        <div class="pending-icon">
          ⏳
        </div>

        <h1>
          طلبك قيد المراجعة
        </h1>

        <p class="pending-subtitle">
          تم استلام طلبك وإثبات الدفع بنجاح.
          يجري الآن مراجعة بياناتك،
          وسيتم تفعيل الحساب <strong>بعد مراجعة الدعم</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="pending-status">

          <div class="pending-step">
            <div class="pending-step-icon">📩</div>
            <div class="pending-step-text">
              <strong>تم استلام الطلب</strong>
              <span>وصلنا طلب التسجيل الخاص بك بنجاح.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pending-step">
            <div class="pending-step-icon">🧾</div>
            <div class="pending-step-text">
              <strong>تم استلام إثبات الدفع</strong>
              <span>يجري مراجعة الصورة والبيانات المرفقة.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pending-step">
            <div class="pending-step-icon">✅</div>
            <div class="pending-step-text">
              <strong>التفعيل بعد مراجعة الدعم</strong>
              <span>بمجرد المراجعة سيتم تفعيل الحساب لتبدأ استخدام المنصة.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="pending-note">
          لو تأخر التفعيل قليلًا فلا تقلق،
          طلبك محفوظ وسيتم مراجعته في أقرب وقت.
        </div>

        <div class="pending-actions">
          <a href="/" class="pending-btn primary">
            العودة لتسجيل الدخول
          </a>

          <a href="/signup" class="pending-btn ghost">
            تعديل / تسجيل مرة أخرى
          </a>
        </div>

      </section>

      <div class="pending-footer">
        ⚛ Physics Learning Platform
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>


  <script>
    if ("serviceWorker" in navigator) {
      window.addEventListener("load", function () {
        navigator.serviceWorker
          .register("/service-worker.js")
          .then(function (registration) {
            console.log("Service Worker registered:", registration.scope);
          })
          .catch(function (error) {
            console.error("Service Worker registration failed:", error);
          });
      });
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
